hu-093","source_id":"s-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context-ws1548000","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p001","quote":"何准，字幼道，穆章皇后父也。高尚寡欲，弱冠知名，州府交辟，並不就。兄充為驃騎將軍，勸其令仕，准曰：「第五之名何滅驃騎？」准兄弟中第五，故有此言。充居宰輔之重，權傾一時，而准散帶衡門，不及人事，唯誦佛經，修營塔廟而已。徵拜散騎郎，不起。年四十七卒。昇平元年，追贈金紫光祿大夫，封晉興縣侯。子惔以父素行高潔，表讓不受。三子：放、惔、澄。放繼充。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p001:m0162","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p001:m0000"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"何准傳以三子連舉三人。","human_reviewed":false}},{"id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_DB","label":"何元度（何惔子）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"元度","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-093-heyu-he-shudu:p001:m0002"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-093","source_id":"s-jinshu-093-heyu-he-shudu-ws1548000","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-he-shudu","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-he-shudu:p001","quote":"元度","mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-he-shudu:p001:m0002"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"晉93何惔子，西陽太守；與弟叔度分人。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_D","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi024-wangsiyuan-he-yuandu","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-093","source_id":"s-jinshu-093-heyu-he-shudu-ws1548000","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-he-shudu","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-he-shudu:p001","quote":"惔子元度，西陽太守；次叔度，太常卿、尚書。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-he-shudu:p001:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-he-shudu:p001:m0000"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本句列父子，承接詞限本見證。","human_reviewed":false}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-jinshu-093-heyu-he-shudu-ws1548000","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-093","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-he-shudu","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-jinshu-093-heyu-he-shudu:p001:m0002"],"